  Issue body actions
  
  ### Description of the bug
  
  ST starts lagging badly after typing a few hundred characters. This seems to be related to the size of the window. When the window is maximized at 2560x1440, it does that.
  
  ### Steps to reproduce
  
  1. Start ST in safe mode (`subl --safe-mode`)
  2. Maximize window
  3. Start typing. It starts lagging noticeably after about 100 characters
  
  ### Expected behavior
  
  Typing plain text should be snappy
  
  ### Actual behavior
  
  Noticeably lag, until it is behind by entire words when typing at a reasonable rate (60-ish WPM)
  
  ### Sublime Text build number
  
  4200
  
  ### Operating system & version
  
  MacOS 15.7.1
  
  ### (Linux) Desktop environment and/or window manager
  
  _No response_
  
  ### Additional information
  
  Hardware: Macbook Pro 2024, M4 Pro, 48GB memory
  
  Also did a full uninstall and reinstall, which did not help.
  
